{"id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-lob-theorem.md","title":"Löb's Theorem","display":"thm-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-lob-theorem","aliases":["89-thm-lob-theorem"],"display":"thm-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-thm-lob-internal]]","[[89-df-lob-theorem]]","[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-lob-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-lob-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1c8bb923975db7e\" href=\"?note=a1c8bb923975db7e\" title=\"89-thm-lob-internal\">89-thm-lob-internal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cbce44a943995a0\" href=\"?note=6cbce44a943995a0\" title=\"89-df-lob-theorem\">89-df-lob-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> 为递归可枚举且扩张 PA 的算术理论；本条固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span> is the fixed arithmetical provability formula and\nsatisfies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)\\)</span> is the property from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cbce44a943995a0\" href=\"?note=6cbce44a943995a0\" title=\"89-df-lob-theorem\">89-df-lob-theorem</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos，第 3 章 pp.59–62；印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi\\)</span>，HB 第一条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)\\)</span>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a1c8bb923975db7e\" href=\"?note=a1c8bb923975db7e\" title=\"89-thm-lob-internal\">89-thm-lob-internal</a> 再给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)\\)</span>，最后 MP 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\\)</span>。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_T\">\\(P_T\\)</span> 取该原子已展开的句法缩写。</p>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> : 可证性谓词 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li>Löb定理：如果&quot;可证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>蕴涵<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>&quot;可证，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可证</li>\n<li>GL逻辑的核心定理，揭示可证性的奇特性质</li>\n<li>对象语言数码及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> 的展开已集中在\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6cbce44a943995a0\" href=\"?note=6cbce44a943995a0\" title=\"89-df-lob-theorem\">89-df-lob-theorem</a>，这里不再复制一份易错签名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-lob-internal","status":"resolved","id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-lob-internal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","status":"resolved","id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)$ is the property from [[89-df-lob-theorem]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-lob-internal","status":"resolved","id":"a1c8bb923975db7e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"证明：若 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi$，HB 第一条件给出 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)$；[[89-thm-lob-internal]] 再给出 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)$，最后 MP 得 $T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi$。这里的 $P_T$ 取该原子已展开的句法缩写。","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ : 可证性谓词 (see [[89-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对象语言数码及 $\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)$ 的展开已集中在\n[[89-df-lob-theorem]]，这里不再复制一份易错签名。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_{T})\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(P_T(\\varphi)\\to\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}P_T(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"P_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1646,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1c8665663a75504","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"第二不完备性定理的模态形式 (see [[89-thm-lob-theorem]])"},{"id":"0517fc365e0749bc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f04ebe4ce16b21f5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由 $H$ 的固定点等价得到\n$\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{\\ulcorner H\\urcorner})\\to H$ 可证，再应用\n[[89-thm-lob-theorem]]。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]] → [[89-thm-generalized-diagonal-lemma]] → [[89-thm-lob-internal]] → [[89-thm-lob-theorem]] → [[89-df-reflection-principle]] → [[89-df-gls-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["a1c8bb923975db7e","6cbce44a943995a0","9aca87310232fb2f","841985de31202f85"]}